msgbox	Hehehe! Even TEAM AQUA joins us!But it's too much trouble to deal with you all…Heh, it doesn't matter!We've got the METEORITE, so off to MT. CHIMNEY we go!Hehehe! Be seeing you, you TEAM AQUA dingbats!
