msgbox	ARCHIE: Didn't I see you before? At SLATEPORT's MUSEUM?Ah, so your name is PLAYER.At the time, I thought you were one of TEAM MAGMA's goons.Humph… You're one odd kid.TEAM MAGMA is a dangerous group of total fanatics.They engage in destruction, claiming to expand the land mass.They are the rivals to us, the sea-loving TEAM AQUA!
closemessage
