msgbox	I… I'm COZMO… I'm a PROFESSOR…TEAM MAGMA asked me to guide them to METEOR FALLS…But they tricked me. They even took my METEORITE away…And then another similar bunch, TEAM AQUA showed up.After that… I don't understand any of it.But that TEAM MAGMA…What are they going to do with that METEORITE at MT. CHIMNEY?
release
end
